[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19982.47, "timestamp": "05:33:02", "text": "。 [音樂]但再說一遍，別太當真。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19987.83, "timestamp": "05:33:07", "text": "我是一個……我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19989.59, "timestamp": "05:33:09", "text": "猜"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19991.83, "timestamp": "05:33:11", "text": "我還沒真正體驗過人生，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19998.548, "timestamp": "05:33:18", "text": "我說的都是基於我自己的經驗。我見過掙扎，經歷過各種各樣的事情，所以我的話可能不太準確，也不知道對你有沒有幫助，但謝謝你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20022.15, "timestamp": "05:33:42", "text": "等等。我們應該開始第二輪直播了，我忘了。呃，我們這次直播要播多久？六分鐘。哦，我是從三分鐘"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20030.89, "timestamp": "05:33:50", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "NOOO"}]